    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an ordinary office clerk in a not-so-ordinary world ruled by demons. One of them is your boss. Will you lead the company to success, or will you try to hold on to your humanity? Complete tasks, solve puzzles, avoid other employees, sacrifice humans\u2026 What? You didn\u2019t read the contract?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must carry out the orders of your superiors just to have a chance at surviving in this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is on the brink of extinction, but maybe you can make things a little better - or will you use all your strength to win the favor of your new leadership?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/2b9d858c7730b2a0bcc492048cc0a982.poster.avif?t=1746644938\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/2b9d858c7730b2a0bcc492048cc0a982.webm?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/2b9d858c7730b2a0bcc492048cc0a982.mp4?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your boss's tasks to secure at least some guarantees of safety. If you work hard and diligently, you might even receive certain bonuses. But if you fail\u2026 there will be consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/d16bb8f448ce47fa6aee98f70c98f4f7.poster.avif?t=1746644938\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/d16bb8f448ce47fa6aee98f70c98f4f7.webm?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/d16bb8f448ce47fa6aee98f70c98f4f7.mp4?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how this new world works. Talk to demons and other humans to understand the rules of this new reality. Gather information and find new items for your shelter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/8ccdb0756b0c6265549edaf99581fe19.poster.avif?t=1746644938\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/8ccdb0756b0c6265549edaf99581fe19.webm?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/8ccdb0756b0c6265549edaf99581fe19.mp4?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an employee of the largest and only demonic corporation, you might have the power to change the course of events\u2026 or you can fully embrace the new regime. Your choices will have consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new world and learn its rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks assigned by your superiors. If you do everything perfectly, you'll be rewarded, but if you make a mistake\u2026 expect consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to other humans or demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the interactive environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret locations in your office building. Who knows what awaits around the corner?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your choices in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to improve your shelter or uncover additional information</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an ordinary office clerk in a not-so-ordinary world ruled by demons. One of them is your boss. Will you lead the company to success, or will you try to hold on to your humanity? Complete tasks, solve puzzles, avoid other employees, sacrifice humans\u2026 What? You didn\u2019t read the contract?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must carry out the orders of your superiors just to have a chance at surviving in this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is on the brink of extinction, but maybe you can make things a little better - or will you use all your strength to win the favor of your new leadership?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/2b9d858c7730b2a0bcc492048cc0a982.poster.avif?t=1746644938\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/2b9d858c7730b2a0bcc492048cc0a982.webm?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/2b9d858c7730b2a0bcc492048cc0a982.mp4?t=1746644938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your boss's tasks to secure at least some guarantees of safety. If you work hard and diligently, you might even receive certain bonuses. But if you fail\u2026 there will be consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541630/extras/d16bb8f448ce47fa6aee98f70c98f4f7.poster.avif?t=1746644938\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a